Package: scythe
Version: 2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Kru Infosec <kru.infosec254@gmail.com>
Description: Scythe -- a Linux desktop application designed to enhance penetration testing and bug bounty workflows. Spin up multiple terminal sessions, run automated Nmap and Nikto scans with a single click, and generate detailed HTML/PDF reports—all within the app. Integrated LLaMA 3 AI provides instant guidance, allowing you to ask follow-up questions during tests and get real-time answers without leaving the interface.
